  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Mutant_Ranged_Wasp.png\" title=\"Mutant Ranged Wasp\"><img alt=\"Mutant Ranged Wasp\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/recovered/Mutant_Ranged_Wasp.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Mutant_Ranged_Wasp.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Mutant Ranged Wasp</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race:</b>  Mutant\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Ranger\n</p><p>These bat-like mutants have metal spikes, horns and armor grafted to their bodies.  More importantly, they have a projectile launcher of some sort attached where their tail should be allowing them to attack with elemental bolts from a distance.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mutant Ranged Wasp\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">Storerooms</a>  off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a> offs\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
